# Copy to /etc/agent-circle/alert.env, 0600 root:root. Read by agent-circle-alert,
# which `OnFailure=` runs when a unit fails. Empty URL means alerting is off and the
# notifier exits quietly.
#
# Slack and Discord webhooks are detected and sent as JSON; anything else receives the
# message as a plain-text body, which suits ntfy and most simple receivers.
ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=
# The alert carries the failing unit's last 10 journal lines, which is what makes it
# actionable. Those lines are whatever the unit printed, so treat the destination as
# trusted. Set to 0 to send the unit name alone.
ALERT_INCLUDE_LOG=1
